{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106838","id":2544687989,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6XrNt1","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106838","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106838.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106838.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106838","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106838/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106838/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106838/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8f4a30b4ce8ea88ff96d986d928ad8a5129915a4","number":106838,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `extra_update` option to `BoneAttachment3D` to handle update timing","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106741\r\n\r\nCurrently BoneAttachment only updates once per frame by the skeleton's final result. That is sufficient for equipment, but for IK targets the update timing is late.\r\n\r\nGodot 3.x had updates occurring on every pose changed, which was obviously overkill. Then, in my opinion, IK targets need two updates:\r\n\r\n1. At arbitrary timing (`AnimationMixer.mixer_applied` or `SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed`)\r\n2. On `skeleton_updated` to reflect changes made by **other** SkeletonModifiers\r\n\r\nCurrently only 2 is done. The reason why 2 is needed instead of just 1 is that when other SkeletonModifiers modify the ancestor bone of the IK target, the final rendered appearance must match.\r\n\r\nHowever, when a bone is modified by a non-SkeletonModifier in the scene, not just by AnimationMixer.mixer_applied, we would want to subscribe to it, so I add an `update_pose_started` signal to the Skeleton and connect it to the BoneAttachment.\r\n\r\nThis makes the BoneAttachment have additional two options `extra_update` and `subscribe_modifier`.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b236178-a042-4a8e-8b02-4f196ecc89a5)\r\n\r\n**enum ExtraUpdate:**\r\n- EXTRA_UPDATE_NONE\r\n  - A BoneAttachment3D's transform will only be updated after the Skeleton3D processes all own SkeletonModifier3D's.\r\n- EXTRA_UPDATE_BEFORE_SKELETON_UPDATE\r\n  - A BoneAttachment3D's transform will be updated before the Skeleton3D processes all own SkeletonModifier3D's but also the Skeleton3D processes all own SkeletonModifier3D's.\r\n- EXTRA_UPDATE_SUBSCRIBE_MODIFIER\r\n  - A BoneAttachment3D's transform will be updated after processing the `subscribe_modifier` but also the Skeleton3D processes all own SkeletonModifier3D's\r\n\r\nThey are only available when override_pose is disabled. This is because override_pose is meant to allow writing to bone poses, but since BoneAttachment uses signals to link with Skeleton, the update order is not guaranteed when a BoneAttachment is attached to multiple bones.\r\n\r\nIncludes some refactoring.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-26T19:02:05Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T16:39:25Z","closed_at":"2025-06-05T00:40:20Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"96ae72f5f5bd3c300ebcaf86a8f87a3c1d537ef9","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TokageItLab:bone-attachment-subscribe","ref":"bone-attachment-subscribe","repo":{"id":289170836,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyODkxNzA4MzY=","name":"godot","full_name":"TokageItLab/godot","owner":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://ap